import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 582 | Quest Domain | Dao-Origin Realm Adaptation | Quest for Dao-Principle Condensation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 582 | Quest Domain | Dao-Origin Realm Adaptation | Quest for Dao-Principle Condensation","no":582,"module":3,"tags":["Quest Sediment Domain","Dao-Origin Realm","Dao-Principle Condensation","Quest","Realm Adaptation"],"related":["501-Dual-Track Time Domain Overview","14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification","21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0582_模块3-求索域-道元境适配.md","filePath":"en/0582_模块3-求索域-道元境适配.md"}'),n={name:"en/0582_模块3-求索域-道元境适配.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,p,h){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-582-quest-domain-dao-origin-realm-adaptation-quest-for-dao-principle-condensation" tabindex="-1">Entry 582 | Quest Domain | Dao-Origin Realm Adaptation | Quest for Dao-Principle Condensation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-582-quest-domain-dao-origin-realm-adaptation-quest-for-dao-principle-condensation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 582 | Quest Domain | Dao-Origin Realm Adaptation | Quest for Dao-Principle Condensation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 21; Benchmark library: Entries 571, 581</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-before-legislation-you-must-first-find-yourself" tabindex="-1">Introduction: before legislation, you must first &quot;find yourself&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-before-legislation-you-must-first-find-yourself" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: before legislation, you must first &quot;find yourself&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The acceleration domain designs &quot;100× rapid drafts, real-life testing, Myriad-Rank publication&quot; for Dao-Origin; the Quest Sediment Domain focuses on something more fundamental: before legislation, the cultivator in slow time must first <strong>find himself</strong>. Dao-Principles are not deduced from law clauses, but grow out of &quot;who I am, what I care about, what I am willing to take responsibility for.&quot; These questions cannot be solved by acceleration, must be answered by long, winding, erring real life.</p><p>Six top-level axioms continue here: anti-predation axiom requires Dao-Principles grow out of one&#39;s own life, not copied; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires Dao-Principles withstand Myriad-Rank review; collective ascension axiom requires Dao-Principles ultimately serve Myriad Ranks; causal self-discipline axiom requires once a Dao-Principle is wrongly established there be a correction mechanism; law-first axiom takes &quot;Dao-Origin Quest Gear&quot; as a law clause, never retconned. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-legislation-must-first-find-yourself" tabindex="-1">I. Why Legislation Must First &quot;Find Yourself&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-legislation-must-first-find-yourself" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Legislation Must First &quot;Find Yourself&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A Dao-Principle is the cultivator&#39;s legislation over himself. A person who has not found himself, the Dao-Principle he establishes is either copied, or a slogan. The Quest-Domain Dao-Origin Gear&#39;s task is to let the cultivator in slow time complete a full &quot;self-archaeology&quot;:</p><ul><li>What do I truly care about?</li><li>What am I willing to pay the price for?</li><li>In what situations do I waver?</li><li>What am I willing to take responsibility for to Myriad Ranks?</li></ul><p>These questions have no standard answer, only to be tried over a lifetime.</p><h2 id="ii-quest-domain-dao-origin-gear-parameters" tabindex="-1">II. Quest-Domain Dao-Origin Gear Parameters <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-quest-domain-dao-origin-gear-parameters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Quest-Domain Dao-Origin Gear Parameters&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Explanation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Recommended Flow</td><td>0.3–0.7×</td><td>Close to reality but slightly slower</td></tr><tr><td>Trial Method</td><td>Real-life trials</td><td>Not closed-door, but living, doing, erring, reflecting</td></tr><tr><td>Trial Period</td><td>20–100 real years</td><td>Finding yourself has no timetable</td></tr><tr><td>Experience Product</td><td>Personal Dao-Principle embryo + life-case collection</td><td>Real cases supporting the Dao-Principle</td></tr><tr><td>Exit Standard</td><td>Dao-Principle embryo published to Myriad Ranks with no major objection</td><td>Ensures the Dao-Principle has real-life roots</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This parameter&#39;s essence is &quot;legislating with life.&quot; The cultivator in Quest-Domain Dao-Origin Gear is not writing Dao-Principles in a study, but in real life doing, erring, bearing, then distilling these experiences into a Dao-Principle embryo. His Dao-Principle is not paper writing, but judgment bought with a lifetime&#39;s price.</p><h2 id="iii-the-life-case-collection-s-myriad-rank-value" tabindex="-1">III. The Life-Case Collection&#39;s Myriad-Rank Value <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-life-case-collection-s-myriad-rank-value" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Life-Case Collection&#39;s Myriad-Rank Value&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The &quot;life-case collection&quot; attached to the Dao-Principle embryo is Myriad Ranks&#39; most precious textbook. It records:</p><ul><li>How the cultivator chose in a specific situation;</li><li>What consequences his choice brought;</li><li>What he learned from the consequences;</li><li>How this corrected his Dao-Principle.</li></ul><p>These cases teach Myriad Ranks &quot;how to establish Dao-Principles&quot; better than any technique blueprint. The Alaya Network compiles them into &quot;Myriad-Rank Dao-Principle Studies,&quot; required reading for all冲击 Dao-Origin. This is precisely collective-ascension axiom&#39;s expression in the ethical dimension: <strong>one person&#39;s judgment bought with a lifetime becomes Myriad Ranks&#39; reference when establishing Dao.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-opposition-to-copying-dao-principles" tabindex="-1">IV. Opposition to &quot;Copying Dao-Principles&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-opposition-to-copying-dao-principles" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Opposition to &quot;Copying Dao-Principles&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the predatory-faction system, Dao-Origin&#39;s typical path is &quot;copying Dao-Principles&quot;: select a strong one&#39;s Dao-Principle and copy it, or in closed-door cultivation fabricate a pretty slogan out of thin air. This approach&#39;s problems:</p><ol><li>Copied Dao-Principles do not fit own personality, collapse when things happen;</li><li>Fabricated Dao-Principles have no real-life roots, malfunction at the first concrete choice;</li><li>It trains &quot;Dao-Principle imitators,&quot; not &quot;true legislators.&quot;</li></ol><p>Heng Yuan Zhou in Quest-Domain Dao-Origin Gear makes the &quot;life-case collection&quot; hard material for Dao-Principle review: a Dao-Principle embryo without enough real-case support, at publication必 be rejected. This rule makes &quot;copying Dao-Principles&quot; unworkable on the review ledger.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: supporting Dao-Principles with a lifetime of trials, avoiding establishing a paper blank</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Dao-Principles grow out of one&#39;s own life, not copied, not stolen</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style Dao-Principles rely on protagonist&#39;s talent self-enlightenment, slogan-style; Heng Yuan&#39;s Dao-Principles supported by life cases, published to Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five lineages each have a &quot;find yourself&quot; path; plant spirits&#39; &quot;growth-style self-finding,&quot; planet consciousness&#39;s &quot;balance-style self-finding&quot; also included</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: case-library, Dao-Principle review methods, publication process all public; this is the ethical segment of the open chain</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="vi-anonymization-of-dao-principle-life-case-collections" tabindex="-1">VI. Anonymization of Dao-Principle Life-Case Collections <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-anonymization-of-dao-principle-life-case-collections" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Anonymization of Dao-Principle Life-Case Collections&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Others involved in the case collection are all anonymized; real names are kept only in the Alaya Network&#39;s encrypted layer. When the cultivator publishes, he only shows case structures, not exposing specific parties. This protection lets cultivators dare write real experiences into Dao-Principles, without worrying about hurting those around them. Causal self-discipline axiom here simultaneously protects the legislator and the people around the legislated.</p><h2 id="vii-life-apprenticeship-for-dao-principle-drafts" tabindex="-1">VII. Life Apprenticeship for Dao-Principle Drafts <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-life-apprenticeship-for-dao-principle-drafts" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Life Apprenticeship for Dao-Principle Drafts&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao-Origin Quest Gear besides writing case collections, also requires the cultivator to attend life apprenticeship: work for a time at Myriad Ranks&#39; different posts — as doctor, farmer, teacher, engineer. Apprenticeship is not to learn skills, but to root the Dao-Principle in real human world. A cultivator who has not seen how ordinary people live a day, the Dao-Principle he establishes is doomed to hang in air. Life apprenticeship brings the Dao-Principle from the study back to earth.</p><h2 id="viii-mentorship-for-dao-principle-apprenticeship" tabindex="-1">VIII. Mentorship for Dao-Principle Apprenticeship <a class="header-anchor" href="#viii-mentorship-for-dao-principle-apprenticeship" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VIII. Mentorship for Dao-Principle Apprenticeship&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Life apprenticeship is not wandering alone, but paired with a Dao-Principle mentor: the mentor himself has walked through Dao-Origin, seen countless Dao-Principles&#39; successes and failures. Perplexities encountered during apprenticeship, the cultivator may anytime ask the mentor; the mentor also at key nodes reminds him which experiences are worth writing into the case collection. Mentorship keeps life apprenticeship from going astray, and lets Dao-Principle transmission continue in slowness.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao-Origin&#39;s Quest Gear tells cultivators: before establishing a Dao-Principle, first live yourself clearly. <strong>A Dao-Principle supported by a lifetime of cases is a Dao-Principle truly able to withstand Myriad-Rank review and the test of time.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./571_模块3-加速域-道元境适配.html">571-Acceleration-Domain Dao-Origin Adaptation</a> · <a href="./581_模块3-求索域-法元境适配.html">581-Quest-Domain Law-Origin Adaptation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const f=i(n,[["render",r]]);export{d as __pageData,f as default};
